Task[] completion order: awaited second input, completed first
  Faulted: second input, completed first | first input, completed last
Task<T>[] array order: awaited first input, completed last
  Faulted: first input, completed last | second input, completed first
already completed: awaited one
  Faulted: one | two
canceled: token matches True, status Canceled
several exceptions: awaited single
  Faulted: single | many 1 | many 2
faulted and canceled: awaited faulted wins
  Faulted: faulted wins
